## Platform direction
Не переносить текущий production BRODETAIL целиком как tenant №1 без изоляции.

Целевая схема:
- web SaaS control plane/app;
- managed PostgreSQL with tenant isolation/RLS or equivalent hard boundary;
- queue/event layer;
- connector workers;
- AI gateway/prompt/rules service;
- analytics/derived layer;
- object storage for allowed attachments;
- centralized observability/audit;
- secrets per tenant in secret store, never frontend/repo.

Текущий BRODETAIL остаётся proving ground/source of product learnings, но migration в SaaS выполняется отдельным gated project after architecture review.

## Acceptance for product-definition phase
1. Product promise and ICP agreed.
2. MVP <= 6 core modules; no feature sprawl.
3. 60-minute onboarding target has a concrete wizard.
4. Tenant isolation and shared-learning privacy boundary explicit.
5. Pricing hypothesis + unit economics defined.
6. 3-pilot plan defined.
7. No production/code changes in current BRODETAIL systems.
8. Next engineering phase starts only after current active implementation scopes are free and an isolated SaaS repository/architecture decision is made.

