## 제안

### 아키텍처 — DriverAdapter 추상화 도입

```typescript
// src/dialects/DriverAdapter.ts (신규)
export interface DriverAdapter {
  readonly dialect: "mysql" | "postgres" | "sqlite";
  readonly supportsTransactions: boolean;
  readonly supportsPreparedStatements: boolean;

  acquire(): Promise<AdapterConnection>;
  release(conn: AdapterConnection): Promise<void>;
  close(): Promise<void>;
}

export interface AdapterConnection {
  execute(sql: string, params: unknown[]): Promise<AdapterResult>;
  beginTransaction(): Promise<void>;
  commit(): Promise<void>;
  rollback(): Promise<void>;
}

export interface AdapterResult {
  rows: unknown[];
  fields?: FieldInfo[];
  insertId?: number | string;
  affectedRows?: number;
}
```

### Connector 리팩토링

기존 `MySqlConnector`, `PostgresConnector`, `SqliteConnector`를 `DriverAdapter` 위의 얇은 래퍼로 재구성:

```typescript
class MySqlConnector {
  constructor(private adapter: DriverAdapter) {}

  async query(sql: Sql): Promise<Result> {
    const conn = await this.adapter.acquire();
    try {
      return await conn.execute(sql.text, sql.values);
    } finally {
      await this.adapter.release(conn);
    }
  }
}
```

### 제공할 Adapter

1차 (MVP):
- `NodeMySqlAdapter` — mysql2 래핑 (기존 호환)
- `NodePostgresAdapter` — pg 래핑 (기존 호환)
- `NodeSqliteAdapter` — better-sqlite3 래핑 (기존 호환)

2차 (Edge):
- `NeonHttpAdapter` — `@neondatabase/serverless` (HTTP + WebSocket)
- `LibSqlAdapter` — `@libsql/client` (Turso, HTTP/WS)
- `D1Adapter` — Cloudflare D1 binding (Workers 환경)

3차:
- `PlanetScaleAdapter` — `@planetscale/database` (Vitess MySQL 호환 제약 검토)
- `MySqlBunAdapter` / `PostgresBunAdapter` — Bun built-in 소켓

